# Trivy suppressions.
#
# Rules for this file:
#   - every entry needs a reason and an expiry date
#   - "noisy" is not a reason; "not reachable because X" is
#   - expired entries are removed, not renewed by default
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Reference: https://trivy.dev/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/

# No active suppressions.
#
# Note on the corpus: corpus/fixtures and corpus/protected contain small Go
# programs built deliberately as analysis targets, including an intentionally
# obfuscated sample. They are inputs to the test suite, never dependencies of
# the shipped binary, and are excluded via skip-dirs in .github/workflows/trivy.yml
# rather than suppressed here.
